{"full": [{"x": 219, "h": 46, "t": "Sport Power Endurance - B...", "y": 173}, {"h": 28, "y": 383, "t": "• 3 hours / week", "x": 728}, {"h": 38, "t": "Add To Training Plan", "x": 334, "y": 505}, {"y": 693, "x": 52, "h": 39, "t": "Overview"}, {"y": 781, "t": "This 6-week program is designed for sport climbers", "h": 42, "x": 52}, {"t": "that are new to structured training and would like to", "y": 829, "x": 48, "h": 39}, {"x": 52, "t": "build a foundation of power endurance to prepare for", "h": 41, "y": 875}, {"t": "pumpy sport climbs. The template is designed to be", "x": 52, "y": 924, "h": 38}, {"t": "split across two training days per week.", "h": 38, "y": 973, "x": 48}, {"x": 52, "t": "The first training can be completed at a boulder wall", "y": 1067, "h": 38}, {"t": "and should consist of the Warm Up, followed by either", "x": 52, "h": 45, "y": 1112}, {"t": "6 in 6 (Weeks 1 & 2), Style Triad (Weeks 3 & 6), or", "y": 1157, "h": 45, "x": 52}, {"y": 1206, "h": 38, "t": "Broken Quarters (Weeks 4 & 5).", "x": 52}, {"t": "The second training day will consist of the Route Warm", "h": 42, "x": 52, "y": 1300}, {"x": 52, "y": 1349, "h": 38, "t": "Up Protocol followed by Route Pyramids (except for"}, {"h": 38, "x": 52, "y": 1398, "t": "week 3)."}, {"x": 52, "t": "Additional sessions can be added to this plan to", "y": 1492, "h": 38}, {"y": 1541, "x": 52, "h": 35, "t": "maintain base endurance or strength & power."}, {"x": 52, "t": "Schedule", "h": 35, "y": 1723}, {"t": "Week 1", "x": 52, "y": 1824, "h": 32}, {"h": 31, "t": "Base", "x": 229, "y": 1824}, {"y": 1929, "x": 83, "t": "6 in 6", "h": 31}, {"h": 35, "t": "6 hard boulder problems in 6 minutes", "y": 1973, "x": 90}, {"h": 38, "y": 2079, "t": "Route Pyramid", "x": 94}, {"h": 38, "t": "Route climbing starting on easier climbs, building", "y": 2127, "x": 90}, {"y": 2166, "h": 35, "x": 90, "t": "to max effort and then back down again."}, {"y": 2270, "t": "Warm Up Protocol - Route Climbing", "h": 38, "x": 94}, {"t": "An ea